{
  "title": "TextEffectError",
  "description": "Raised when a text node cannot draw a requested outline or shadow. Thrown synchronously by the operation that would create the unsupported combination - constructing the node, assigning or mutating its style, swapping its font or font scale, or reading a serialized document - and that operation leaves every object unchanged. The renderer never throws it. Callers branch on reason: `'insufficient-effect-capacity'` is fixed by a smaller effect or a node built with more capacity (`Text` `sdfRadius`), the other reasons by a font that carries usable distance-field metadata. AbstractText.checkEffects answers the same question without throwing.",
  "symbol": "TextEffectError",
  "kind": "class",
